Bind Npc 19002 Zone 21
Quest 119 "Wolf Products"
    Journal "Gather 4 Apples of Moradon for [Middle man] Berret."
    Collect 4 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 32

Rewards
    Give 550000 experience

On available
    Say "Berret is looking for something special, right?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Welcome, <selfname>\n Apple of Moradon is just what I've been looking for. Apples of Moradon sell really well around the Luferson Castle area in Karus because it's so cold around there. It profits you to profit from it. Heh heh heh!"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Karus' Luferson Castle area makes special Apples of Moradon, and trades it out to all sorts of places."

On in_progress
    Say "I really want a Apple of Moradon. You'll get a Apple of Moradon from an Any Wolf and Lycan, no problems."

On ready
    Say "Master! You've got a hold of a Apple of Moradon. Now you just need to trade 'em with Berret."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Oh, great, you got all the right stuff and just enough of it too. Thanks. You helped our chief make a big profit there. Well done."
